      <title>Mexican Tourism to the US Defies Trump-Era Decline</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-12/mexican-tourism-to-the-us-defies-trump-era-decline</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">8a2e5c6b1cce7fa5cb5ff652</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:00:27 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Since Donald Trump started his second term as president in January 2025, international visits to the US have fallen more than 6%. There was a modest uptick during the men’s soccer World Cup in June and July, but full numbers for August and partial ones for September from the US International Trade Administration show a resumption of the decline.</description>
