      <title>Defense Spending Can’t Be Hostage to the Iran Standoff</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-12/defense-spending-can-t-be-hostage-to-the-iran-standoff</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">f78920db10094d16d31ad2fb</guid>
