      <title>Democrats 2026 Wins Come as Sunbelt's Political Power Grows</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-12/democrats-2026-wins-come-as-sunbelt-s-political-power-grows</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">eee08a8b33e185304b058082</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:00:27 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Like the cavalry in an old Western, a new generation of Democrats has arrived just in time to restore the party’s competitiveness in the Sunbelt. Democrats last week recorded their best 21st-century showing across an arc of Sunbelt states, including North and South Carolina, Georgia, Texas, Arizona and Nevada. Democrats also picked up a Senate seat in Mississippi and mounted unexpectedly strong bids for another Senate seat in Louisiana as well as the Alabama governorship.</description>
