    <item>
      <title>History Is Calling Europe on Ukraine. Can it Answer?</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-12/history-is-calling-europe-on-ukraine-can-it-answer</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">297020b0e525a4bb5153df44</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:00:43 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>There are reasons to believe an opportunity now exists to reach a peace deal on Ukraine. There’s the mere fact that Russia agreed to attend a new round of trilateral talks in Abu Dhabi this week, the approach of a new, less Moscow-friendly US Congress, the soaring casualty rates among Vladimir Putin’s troops and the unbearable toll on Ukraine’s cities and economy. The rational takeaway from all this, that we are on the threshold of a pact to end the war, is unfortunately misleading.</description>
      <dc:creator>Marc Champion</dc:creator>
